# UX Prototypes — OneOhm V2 Design System

> **Compact, pixel-accurate, consistent. Never generic.**

---

## 📐 Layout Dimensions

| Element | Size |
|---------|------|
| Header | 48px height |
| Rail | 48px width |
| Panel | 200px width |
| Content padding | 16px (p-4) |

---

## 🔤 Typography

| Use | Class | Weight |
|-----|-------|--------|
| Body text | `text-[13px]` | 400 (normal) |
| Labels | `text-[13px] font-medium` | 500 |
| Titles | `text-[15px] font-semibold` | 600 |
| Badges | `text-[11px]` | 500 |

**NEVER use `font-bold` (700)**

---

## 🎨 Colors & Borders

| Property | Standard | Avoid |
|----------|----------|-------|
| Borders | `border-gray-100` | border-gray-200 |
| Background | `bg-white` or `bg-gray-50` | — |
| Shadow | `shadow-sm` or none | shadow-md+ |

---

## 📦 Spacing

| Property | Standard | Avoid |
|----------|----------|-------|
| Padding | `p-4` | p-5, p-6 |
| Gap | `gap-3` or `gap-4` | gap-6+ |
| Radius | `rounded-lg` | rounded-xl, rounded-2xl |

---

## 📊 Tables

| Property | Standard |
|----------|----------|
| Row height | `py-2` (44px comfortable) |
| Header | `text-[11px] font-medium text-gray-500` |
| Cell text | `text-[13px]` |
| Hover | `hover:bg-gray-50` |

---

## 🏷️ Badges

```html
<span class="text-[11px] font-medium px-2 py-0.5 rounded-md bg-green-50 text-green-700">
  Active
</span>
```

